# Keeps the build context small and the image reproducible: node_modules
# is a pnpm workspace symlink on the host (would not resolve the same way
# inside the build, and npm ci rebuilds it from package-lock.json anyway),
# and test/ (including its fixture, a few hundred KB of real Cardmarket
# data) has no reason to ship in the runtime image.
node_modules
test
npm-debug.log
